# peanut butter Sandwich


## Overview
-2 slices of bread 
-one jar of peanut butter
-one butter knife
-one napkin
-one plate

## Assumptions
-robot's hands are empty
-all items are placed individually in front of robot in an assembly line formation
-robot is starting in a neutral standing position
=bread is not in a bag. bread is already placed within the assembly line formation stacked together. 
-jar of peanut butter should be opened after twisting top.

## Instructions
1. with one hand, gently grab a single slice of bread.
2. place the single slice of bread in hand onto the plate. 
3. release the bread from hand that is holding the bread. 
4. pick up jar of peanut butter with hand one hand around center of cylinder container. 
5. place other hand on top of peanut butter jar lid. 
6. hold center of jar firmly with hand that is placed there.
7. twist top of jar to the left with hand that is placed there.
8. repeat until top is removed.
9. place top down on workspace.
10. remove protective seal if one is in place.
11. with your free hand, robot will pick up the butter knife.
12. turn the butter knife in hand until blade is pointed down.
13. slowly insert knife into jar of peanut butter.
14. stop when tip of the butter knife reaches the bottom of the jar.
15. withdraw butter knife from the jar. 
16. rotate wrist until knife is held in horizontal position
17. lower knife to the slice of breaad that is already placed on the plate until it makes contact.
18. move knife around until peanut butter is on the bread.
19. place knife on the napkin.
20. with one hand, retrieve remaining slice of bread. 
21. place bread in hand on top of other slice of bread on plate. 


## Done When
-bread is stacked on top of one another with peanut butter in between.
-sandwitch is on the plate


